    "talent": [
      {
        "key": "西風槍術 · 鏑傳",
        "title": "西風槍術 · 鏑傳",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/14/84496276/241eba6e4c00020975cf91170050f435_9219864039309946416.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffd680>普通攻擊</color>\n造成2點 <color=#ffffff>物理傷害</color> 。"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": null
      },
      {
        "key": "星霜的流旋",
        "title": "星霜的流旋",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/14/84496276/ed9f203cd6405eca000741a0a95009c0_8776985111375993536.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffd680>元素戰技</color>\n造成2點 <color=#99ffff>冰元素傷害</color> ，生成 <color=#ffffff>靈風</color> 。\n<color=#ffffff>靈風</color>\n<color=#ffd680>出戰狀態</color>\n<color=#ffffff>我方角色「普通攻擊」後：</color> 該角色本回合下次「普通攻擊」少花費2個 <color=#ffffff>無色元素</color> 。\n<color=#ffffff>可用次數：1</color>"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      },
      {
        "key": "蒼翎的頌願",
        "title": "蒼翎的頌願",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/14/84496276/143b8e76d41a9c74a09c00ae38ce27ad_7907440835325885913.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffd680>元素爆發</color>\n治療我方全體角色1點，生成 <color=#ffffff>鷹翎心得</color> 和 <color=#ffffff>鷹翎祝念</color> 。\n<color=#ffffff>鷹翎心得</color>\n<color=#ffd680>出戰狀態</color>\n我方角色「普通攻擊」少花費1個元素骰。\n<color=#ffffff>可用次數：2</color>\n<color=#ffffff>鷹翎祝念</color>\n<color=#ffd680>出戰狀態</color>\n我方角色「普通攻擊」後治療自身1點。\n<color=#ffffff>可用次數：2</color>"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      },
      {
        "key": "速射牽制",
        "title": "速射牽制",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/14/84496276/a2a9542700e8a16645be739be4f58137_2696039964574185934.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffd680>被動技能</color>\n【被動】 <color=#ffffff>自身使用技能後：</color> 下次我方造成的 <color=#ffffff>物理傷害</color> +1。（每回合2次）"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      },
      {
        "key": "冰元素傷害",
        "title": "冰元素傷害",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/14/84496276/4bcc4b82a9d7ee22770f60afa54e9919_6778152407816350513.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "附著冰元素，可發生元素反應：\n【 <color=#99ffff>冰元素</color> + <color=#ff9999>火元素</color> 】 <color=#ffffff>融化</color> ：本傷害+2\n【 <color=#99ffff>冰元素</color> + <color=#ffacff>雷元素</color> 】 <color=#ffffff>超導</color> ：本傷害+1，對目標以外的所有敵方角色造成1點穿透傷害\n【 <color=#99ffff>冰元素</color> + <color=#80c0ff>水元素</color> 】 <color=#ffffff>凍結</color> ：本傷害+1，使目標本回合無法行動（受到物理或火元素傷害後提前解除，但是傷害+2）"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      },
      {
        "key": "規則解釋",
        "title": "規則解釋",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/14/84496276/07bae546ac7c69ef6402170b283840c5_4473825306134484541.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffffff>物理傷害</color>\n物理傷害不會附著元素，也不會發生元素反應。\n<color=#ffffff>無色元素</color>\n可以用任意類型的元素骰子組合，來支付此類費用。\n<color=#ffffff>可用次數</color>\n此牌效果觸發後，會消耗1次 <color=#ffffff>可用次數</color> ；\n<color=#ffffff>可用次數</color> 耗盡後，立刻棄置此牌。"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      }
    ],
